   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "In order:\n\n1. Scope: in_scope below 0.5 is a 422\n2. Intent: request override, else the judge\n3. Normalise: time trends run over start year,\n   geographic over country, a second grouping\n   only for trends and distributions\n4. Flags: recruiting only (0.7), combination (0.6),\n   phase filter (0.5)\n5. Arms: one per compared drug, condition,\n   sponsor or country; else one arm\n6. Limits: top 10, 15 countries, 25 rows, 40 edges\n7. Chart: the judge's chart if the matrix allows it,\n   else its next most likely allowed chart;\n   scatter and bars on maps only when asked for\n\nEvery override is a note in the response.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "plan",
   "originalText": "In order:\n\n1. Scope: in_scope below 0.5 is a 422\n2. Intent: request override, else the judge\n3. Normalise: time trends run over start year,\n   geographic over country, a second grouping\n   only for trends and distributions\n4. Flags: recruiting only (0.7), combination (0.6),\n   phase filter (0.5)\n5. Arms: one per compared drug, condition,\n   sponsor or country; else one arm\n6. Limits: top 10, 15 countries, 25 rows, 40 edges\n7. Chart: the judge's chart if the matrix allows it,\n   else its next most likely allowed chart;\n   scatter and bars on maps only when asked for\n\nEvery override is a note in the response.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11,
   "autoResize": true
  },
